", "content": "to produce "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to create; to make "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We all produced a great amount of work in our final year. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move up "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He rose to the top of the class. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "born to be"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " destined"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He was born to be a great businessman. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stimulating"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "causing interest and enthusiasm  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: The accounting classes were stimulating."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grateful"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "thankful  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are grateful to our teachers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to make a difference "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have a significant effect "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We hope to make a difference in the business world!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le13ob09aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a job you want."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Research the courses and career step to the job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write how you plan to get to that position."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your plan to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research a job I want."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write my plans to get there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about my future plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my plan aloud."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le13ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le13ob09re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le13ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Peter's Dream Valedictorian Speech<br/><br/>As the top-ranking student in our business class, it's my job to inspire you! <br/>\n<br>What a year it was! We worked while we were studying. We read while we were eating lunch! When we went to class we were constantly producing. How did I rise to the top? I was born to be in business! What were you born to do?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le13ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "What will we do now? We may not all get the job of our dreams. We may have to start at the bottom and work our way to the top. We might be lucky and find that perfect place. Only time will tell.", "id": 2, "time": "25000", "image": "engenn5le13ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "I want to thank our teachers. We loved those stimulating accounting classes. I will always be grateful to Mr. Philips. I am sure many of you feel the same way! <br/><br/>Now let's get out there and make a difference. We are the future!", "id": 3, "time": "38500", "image": "engenn5le13ob09re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "la